 "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/66629b28/uploads/origins/deea34f9-e8f3-45f4-81ec-34a731b7b251?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=563c7e46c89baedd7715ea4562f78aad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66629b28/uploads/origins/deea34f9-e8f3-45f4-81ec-34a731b7b251?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=563c7e46c89baedd7715ea4562f78aad, https://si.imgix.net/66629b28/uploads/origins/deea34f9-e8f3-45f4-81ec-34a731b7b251?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb494315cfb4cbc6642a18d30d8e68ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66629b28/uploads/origins/deea34f9-e8f3-45f4-81ec-34a731b7b251?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=778b7c7428bfbf9d4214b85ea4fceefd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、城先生。明けましておめでとうございます！先生の作品がとても大好きで、よろしければまた私の夢絵を描いていただけると嬉しいです。構図とポーズなど全部自由に描いていただけるとありがたいです☺️\nご依頼内容や金額について何か問題がございましたら、気楽に返送したり、再送信してください。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\n- 財前譲治\n創作落語を書く文芸部男子高生、自分の文を読んでくれる人はみな親友だと思う。  \n- 夢主\n友達の妹の友達で知り合いの女の子。 くせ毛がコンプレックスである共通点に話を開き、作品を読ませる親しい間柄になった。\n\n- 二人とも微妙なギャグセンスを持っていて、他人に理解されにくい。 奇妙なテンションで自分たちだけで楽しむ不思議な組み合わせ。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RouUrPp4ZQO2cvUzlZmvhvyQLWlEYNEz", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0bf460a0/uploads/origins/9ece7115-950f-479d-a005-7102f59bfe22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7b9e9d04331039d208346d0bf73c099d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0bf460a0/uploads/origins/9ece7115-950f-479d-a005-7102f59bfe22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7b9e9d04331039d208346d0bf73c099d, https://si.imgix.net/0bf460a0/uploads/origins/9ece7115-950f-479d-a005-7102f59bfe22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc980fc3b5d8da395d762cea0acaa5a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0bf460a0/uploads/origins/9ece7115-950f-479d-a005-7102f59bfe22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=02930efc3e494995697e86622ad0aec9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef2a6a1e/uploads/origins/98e526cf-e64d-44fa-943f-d71e74228392?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6f1a8036fd6dba6da0ef25525a9bb51", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ef2a6a1e/uploads/origins/98e526cf-e64d-44fa-943f-d71e74228392?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6f1a8036fd6dba6da0ef25525a9bb51, https://si.imgix.net/ef2a6a1e/uploads/origins/98e526cf-e64d-44fa-943f-d71e74228392?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8d828d866ed842309897d5469db0e4d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef2a6a1e/uploads/origins/98e526cf-e64d-44fa-943f-d71e74228392?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca1fa82dc8bdc0f221b22640046f5f23 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生！いつも素敵な作品を拝見しています。先生がお描きになった作品が本当に大好きで、よろしければまた私のOCを描いていただけると嬉しいです。可能であれば、今 敏監督の映画『パーフェクトブルー』（1997年）と、劇中に登場するアイドルとストーカーをテーマにしていただければ幸いです。女の子の衣装は基本的にホワイトトーン、男は黒を基調でお願いします。ご依頼内容や金額について何か問題がございましたら、気楽に返送したり、再送信してください。よろしくお願いいたします。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XiHafsgwCdJ3ILRgry-cpbZ1LpG9F0B9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/17629ee4/uploads/origins/5273d1ab-66a3-43fa-8ceb-a06c01e20b33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a12225d096a562ed62e4024976a54e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17629ee4/uploads/origins/5273d1ab-66a3-43fa-8ceb-a06c01e20b33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a12225d096a562ed62e4024976a54e2, https://si.imgix.net/17629ee4/uploads/origins/5273d1ab-66a3-43fa-8ceb-a06c01e20b33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3928945a47b088b41770a098e15b07ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17629ee4/uploads/origins/5273d1ab-66a3-43fa-8ceb-a06c01e20b33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f81087d190d5cae343003770bb40401 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, Mr. Castle! I really, really love all the works I have received so far... and I would like to request you to draw my character again!\nYour characters have an ambiguous relationship, but never try to confirm the relationship. The character with the eye patch is a Feng Shui and Xuan Xue expert, likes skinship, and is a reassuring figure who appears frivolous but is like an elder. The character without the eye patch is a nihilist who is supreme in reason, cool but sees the other person as the most important person, and thinks of himself as a superior person.\n\nThere are two different clothing styles for the characters in the link, so we hope you can choose whichever you like best. We will continue to support your work for a long time to come!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yYVFqdTC7RLgBuF39fFzopteR04n-Wd5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f778c2be/uploads/origins/a42b13ff-ea9c-4a2f-aae2-57675e4de4a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a1adab75cc2b56cb0268b78cd2a45b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f778c2be/uploads/origins/a42b13ff-ea9c-4a2f-aae2-57675e4de4a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a1adab75cc2b56cb0268b78cd2a45b5, https://si.imgix.net/f778c2be/uploads/origins/a42b13ff-ea9c-4a2f-aae2-57675e4de4a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=803dd59f9376778139aeac6c5779dda3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f778c2be/uploads/origins/a42b13ff-ea9c-4a2f-aae2-57675e4de4a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcfc6ebb955d5394b96091255db06edb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生！素晴らしい作品をありがとうございます。以前お願いしたペアのOCがとても気に入っており、今回もぜひ先生に依頼させていただきたいです。もしよろしければ、「アイドルパロ」の資料を参考に、アイドルの女の子とアイドルオタク（キモオタ）のパロディを描いていただけると大変嬉しいです。ご依頼内容や金額について何か問題がございましたら、気楽に返送したり、再送信してください！ どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！　\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XiHafsgwCdJ3ILRgry-cpbZ1LpG9F0B9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/137dbb0c/uploads/origins/0378c220-17e5-45e8-9ea4-b71437894a7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=629c1fd32427b37e6ce55694f37a1549", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/137dbb0c/uploads/origins/0378c220-17e5-45e8-9ea4-b71437894a7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=629c1fd32427b37e6ce55694f37a1549, https://si.imgix.net/137dbb0c/uploads/origins/0378c220-17e5-45e8-9ea4-b71437894a7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12a3385063c5e1f39d8666a2e20d68c1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/137dbb0c/uploads/origins/0378c220-17e5-45e8-9ea4-b71437894a7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=387a2f83f662be04637642cc0bd21c63 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I saw it in the new arrivals and requested to see my original character in Mr. Jou's design.\n\nIf I had to describe the world of my creation in a nutshell, it would be \"con man x detective x slapstick horror\".\nThey are a con man and a detective, and the con man has a weakness for the detective man, forcing him to cooperate in the investigation of a bizarre case.\n\nBelow is a brief description of the characters.\n\n.........\n\nCharacter 1: A man in a robe.\nA guru of a new religion and a con man.\nHe is in an unfortunate position where he is threatened by a detective man and keeps getting involved in bizarre cases.\nHis facial expressions and reactions are large and emotional.\nHe has a special power to see other people's thoughts.\n\nCharacter 2: The Man in the Suit\nHe is a skilled detective in the Investigation Department of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department.\nHe is trusted by those around him, but his true nature is that of a black-hearted man who will stop at nothing to achieve his goals.\nHe is powerful and tends to use violence to solve problems.\n\n.........\n\nFor more information, please refer to the following URL.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vel_Q4_ZHoSsEiAEqtpJ57qam7Y1Nw-T\n\n\nIf there are any shortfalls in the amount, we would appreciate it if you could cancel the order.\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vel_Q4_ZHoSsEiAEqtpJ57qam7Y1Nw-T", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7666815/uploads/origins/09ddf38f-ab40-495f-9998-59019286e795?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcf894c9d3e2b829f0a5b7d807eaf686", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b7666815/uploads/origins/09ddf38f-ab40-495f-9998-59019286e795?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcf894c9d3e2b829f0a5b7d807eaf686, https://si.imgix.net/b7666815/uploads/origins/09ddf38f-ab40-495f-9998-59019286e795?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=648141045c7e01e15451b13ded21e35a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b7666815/uploads/origins/09ddf38f-ab40-495f-9998-59019286e795?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=008bfe285a3cdd7a0f53a20986e8e3d8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/832a32a6/uploads/origins/745a67cf-53f3-41f0-8d3a-9bfa8c8d5040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac78525ccbeaf04f0d4f39da134e38e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/832a32a6/uploads/origins/745a67cf-53f3-41f0-8d3a-9bfa8c8d5040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac78525ccbeaf04f0d4f39da134e38e4, https://si.imgix.net/832a32a6/uploads/origins/745a67cf-53f3-41f0-8d3a-9bfa8c8d5040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94fdb30f2c99ef983ddfdaf1631fa833 2x, https://si.imgix.net/832a32a6/uploads/origins/745a67cf-53f3-41f0-8d3a-9bfa8c8d5040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c8cff7ae868491867666da51b9159e5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Mr. Shiro, it is nice to meet you! I really like your style and sense of style, so I made a request this time!\n\nIf it is possible, I would like you to draw a couple of people that I used in a TRPG (I have already given permission to the other one)! (I have already given permission to the other one.)\n\n(I have already given permission for the other one.) [Material URL\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jueyLXd20E7V5Iv4cgCEKll9As-QFynk\n\n■Details\nA high school boy and a murderous girl. (1) accidentally ends up sheltering (2). At first, (1) is wary of him, but later they become inseparable friends who love each other dearly. (2) often gazes lovingly at (1).\n\nShion Haruka\nMale/17 years old/180cm\nA high school boy who is a little depressed, quiet, and not the type to stand out. He likes games and two-dimensional things.\nHe has a pair of upturned eyes and a hunched eyebrow. He wears an eye patch over his right eye and a bandage on his arm.\nImage: ☔️🌸(hydrangea)\n\n(2)Hina\nFemale/age unknown/148cm\nShe is a somewhat out-of-this-world girl who speaks in a fluffy way. She has a very cute appearance.\nShe has light brown eyelashes. She has multiple pearls like water drops in her hair and skirt.\nImage → 🎀🔪.\n\n■Usage\nI would like to use the illustrations for my personal viewing, as well as for my hobby, such as for SNS headers and icons.\n\nI would be happy if you could draw the composition and situation as you like!\n\nIf you would like to consider 🙇‍♀️ please contact me at ......!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/132571bb/uploads/origins/6f128eeb-e1ff-4e40-bbd3-c2384d5f0a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2fb19afc51b2f0fc65237361937c3cd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/132571bb/uploads/origins/6f128eeb-e1ff-4e40-bbd3-c2384d5f0a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2fb19afc51b2f0fc65237361937c3cd, https://si.imgix.net/132571bb/uploads/origins/6f128eeb-e1ff-4e40-bbd3-c2384d5f0a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5adca98cc56672b098e1d9f688a15e8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/132571bb/uploads/origins/6f128eeb-e1ff-4e40-bbd3-c2384d5f0a53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=428dbe379da2f5b0940f5c9d17a708f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。いつも作品を拝見しています。先生だけの独特なデフォルメと色味がとても好きです。よろしければ私のocを依頼したいです。可能なら、内田温の<わぎりのハニー> という曲のミュージックビデオ(https://youtu.be/8fbdMLtz7qg?si=61jGmsCEa0z_4886)をモチーフにして描いていただければ嬉しいです。要請内容や金額などに問題があれば気軽に返送してください！\n\nキャラクター資料: \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XiHafsgwCdJ3ILRgry-cpbZ1LpG9F0B9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37398f1c/uploads/origins/8665a3e0-0660-494d-b089-fe2256faee85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd41aedebebee2c9284b5e342d65392a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37398f1c/uploads/origins/8665a3e0-0660-494d-b089-fe2256faee85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd41aedebebee2c9284b5e342d65392a, https://si.imgix.net/37398f1c/uploads/origins/8665a3e0-0660-494d-b089-fe2256faee85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7369b9f5e01d09f910bfc886bf2d571 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37398f1c/uploads/origins/8665a3e0-0660-494d-b089-fe2256faee85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc6234879964c21a5e906f73f45dc5c6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "間違ったURLを添付してしまっていたため、先日送らせて頂いたリクエストの再送失礼いたします。お手数をお掛けしてしまい申し訳ありません。よろしくお願いいたします。\n\n\nはじめまして。城さんの描かれる絵がとても好きで、私のoc(一人)を描いて頂きたく思い、リクエストを送らせて頂きます。このocはTRPGの探索者でもありますが、いただいた絵を立ち絵として使う予定はございません。以下資料を添付いたします。\n\n絵：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JhMSFIXjysA2EZcbDU4DAc5USiSuhEN6/view?usp=sharing\n\n設定： 榛 依央理(はしばみ・いおり) 院生　23歳　植生地理学をやっている\n10/6生まれ　天秤座 180cm　57kg　痩せている　靴の大きさ29cm\n度がゆるい眼鏡を掛ける時もある 神奈川の港町出身\n色白、指手足が長い(よく余らせている)、長めの黒髪　顔の横に右よりも左の髪を長く下ろしている　後ろ髪は一つに括る　左目の下にほくろ\nものを考える時に右手で左手の小指を持つ癖 父子家庭　家庭環境は良好　母親とは死別　社会人の姉がいそう\n料理がうまい　インスタにその日作った弁当の写真だけ上げ続けてる記録用アカウントがあるかもしれない　魚も捌ける(ときどき父親と釣りに行くため)\n読書も好き\n筆圧強くないから0.3mmシャーペンも使える\n朝はシリアル派\n家では裸足\n海辺を自転車で飛ばすのが好き\n昔から海が好き　考えごとが煮詰まると海に泳ぎに行ったりするせいで研究室がしばしば海の匂いになる\n父親が医者なので多少応急手当・医学の心得がある\n周囲をよく観察しているので回避・聞き耳・精神分析が高い\n院生だし本もぼちぼち読んでいるので図書館も高い\nひらめき・発想豊かなので目星も高い\n海辺で育ってるから泳げる\nフィールドワーク経験がそこそこあるのでナビゲート高め\n話し方や仕草からくる落ち着いた雰囲気でわりと信用される\n説得もできなくはない\n植物の写生をするので絵も描ける\n植生地理学をやっているので植物学・自然が高い\n白か灰色の毛のボルゾイぽくもある\n筋肉量はふつう\n体力がある\n病気もしない\n精神打たれ強め\n人並みの素早さ\n落ち着いた雰囲気\n幸運と知識がとても高い\n\n当方色塗りが苦手で服飾にも明るくないため、城さんのお好きな色遣いで服を着せていただけたらと思います(キャラクターについての情報が少ない状態で丸投げしてしまって申し訳ないです)。ポーズ・構図等はすべておまかせします。不都合等ございましたら取り下げていただいてかまいません。 よろしくお願いいたします。城さんの日々がどうかよいものでありますように！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb3e8a2a/uploads/origins/6840a805-0aec-45a8-87ae-e971c963d3c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b53e90ef5c555cb598521a3b0b2c54b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb3e8a2a/uploads/origins/6840a805-0aec-45a8-87ae-e971c963d3c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b53e90ef5c555cb598521a3b0b2c54b, https://si.imgix.net/eb3e8a2a/uploads/origins/6840a805-0aec-45a8-87ae-e971c963d3c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8016c013bdbb5ca8cec05fc20ab66648 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb3e8a2a/uploads/origins/6840a805-0aec-45a8-87ae-e971c963d3c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=749c81d6c7b159e9e9ad1cc9805d0616 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1f55092/uploads/origins/bad95aa6-ea3e-4e2c-87ec-bdf18c184fa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e29c3b1f10d368e011b637f0d6935302", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d1f55092/uploads/origins/bad95aa6-ea3e-4e2c-87ec-bdf18c184fa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e29c3b1f10d368e011b637f0d6935302, https://si.imgix.net/d1f55092/uploads/origins/bad95aa6-ea3e-4e2c-87ec-bdf18c184fa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c0a604885e87e8d9a6e19728243f3ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d1f55092/uploads/origins/bad95aa6-ea3e-4e2c-87ec-bdf18c184fa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23ece6d2eecbd67c4a63fc1e7b2054b7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really enjoy your art and how you stylize characters. I would like to make a request of my two OCs.\n\nMinori (black hair):\nMinori is a painter. He is a timid and gentle person, and loves animals and nature. People view him as a strange and suspicious person due to a family tragedy from his childhood. He is bad at defending himself when others mock him, but he always stands up for others. \nHe is very religious and can see spirits and demons. He is a paranoid person due to all of this.\n\nCoco (pink hair):\nCoco is a delinquent with a nice side. He gets into street fights often but has a strong sense of justice and tries to protect the weak. He is very kind once you get to know him, and loves helping others. He gets shy easily, and is a a bit of a crybaby. He has a habit of drinking and smoking.\n\nCharacter story:\nTheir story is set in the early 2000s, on an rural island. In their town, there has been an increase in missing people. Both of them know someone who has gone missing during this. The disappearances happen the most in the woods.\nThey are working together to track down the person behind the disappearances, only to find out it's a malevolent spirit. The spirit can be represented with butterflies, and has hallucinogenic effects on anyone that is near it.\n\nThere are 2 collage boards in the link that show the aesthetics of their world, and what their town looks like. Their world is colorful but still gloomy and dark. Feel free to include horror/paranormal motifs! \n\nPlease draw freely! Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13SKRzv84i_ltuaohFINxVD4zNMl9-ENO?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/775c3420/uploads/origins/bb18952b-e6f9-4cff-b7d6-d12897db188e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2116ec52f39f7b1fde118b317f3c2f35", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/775c3420/uploads/origins/bb18952b-e6f9-4cff-b7d6-d12897db188e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2116ec52f39f7b1fde118b317f3c2f35, https://si.imgix.net/775c3420/uploads/origins/bb18952b-e6f9-4cff-b7d6-d12897db188e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=34b10c8d5a5d31537835dad8cf88c415 2x, https://si.imgix.net/775c3420/uploads/origins/bb18952b-e6f9-4cff-b7d6-d12897db188e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=080bb72f93d0ff10ac895c229932add6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8dbdcba/uploads/origins/8dd22cd7-85fe-413e-84dd-5edefa2794dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=839a806416e959a4e82ed82134fa59fd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8dbdcba/uploads/origins/8dd22cd7-85fe-413e-84dd-5edefa2794dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=839a806416e959a4e82ed82134fa59fd, https://si.imgix.net/b8dbdcba/uploads/origins/8dd22cd7-85fe-413e-84dd-5edefa2794dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=add712cc929bb0b5ec41ba909435a0bd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8dbdcba/uploads/origins/8dd22cd7-85fe-413e-84dd-5edefa2794dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84fb3c19bae9d3018237a763cda37441 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI love your paintings and if you don't mind, I would like to ask you to paint my OCs.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xQhoTiS7h4fw7OVCgVSl5KTNwFZ61AEU?usp=drive_link\n\nPose, composition, etc. are all up to you.\nThank you very much! 🙇‍♀️", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3524eacc/uploads/origins/16d603bd-81b3-4c17-a2c4-14da18284262?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9a67f24dac3d7e8cd29f6dfb49c5d50", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3524eacc/uploads/origins/16d603bd-81b3-4c17-a2c4-14da18284262?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9a67f24dac3d7e8cd29f6dfb49c5d50, https://si.imgix.net/3524eacc/uploads/origins/16d603bd-81b3-4c17-a2c4-14da18284262?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4105f864051a43191a1d3f4c8310f265 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3524eacc/uploads/origins/16d603bd-81b3-4c17-a2c4-14da18284262?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a8be8e22eaeb3c378782ba15f689e7d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It is nice to meet you. I happened to see your illustration by chance and was very attracted to it. I would love to have you draw my female police officer oc together.\n\nPolice dog officer (black hair, tied up)\nShe is 25 years old, 170 cm tall, 67 kg.\nShe is a workaholic but mysterious woman. She is a police dog handler in the forensics department. Wears gloves at all times.\n\nMaterials\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BT0NVhC1tdqgwLbpNVlUYk7UDOURsyXh\n\n(2) motorcycle policeman (brown hair)\nShe is 28 years old, 180 cm tall and weighs 86 kg.\nShe is flamboyant and has an older sisterly personality, but also has a side of a badass.\n\nMaterial Material.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-hlnWEqLQrVdZc-eAWYIzP3nR09A0R2z\n\nThey are not a couple, but they are very close in a strange relationship, like best friends, like sisters, like lovers.\nThey are both larger than most women, but (2) is larger than the other.\n\nI am very happy if you could take a look at the materials and draw them as freely as you feel like.\n\nThank you very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/54ad183c/uploads/origins/7851e049-7032-4868-95a6-abca4d3facd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d90ffabd2f291500f6e2faf52c44a1c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54ad183c/uploads/origins/7851e049-7032-4868-95a6-abca4d3facd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d90ffabd2f291500f6e2faf52c44a1c, https://si.imgix.net/54ad183c/uploads/origins/7851e049-7032-4868-95a6-abca4d3facd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a49857fefbebc0b472c53b78ad589402 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54ad183c/uploads/origins/7851e049-7032-4868-95a6-abca4d3facd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=310ae1a047fddec62b398beaa73969f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "城様, 始めまして！\n城様のイラストが大好きで, よければ私のOCカップルをリクエストしたいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DfzI5voS9yy2c3pZ14OsvHBX40Cth7BR?usp=sharing\n\nご自由にお願いします!\n\n金額が足りなかったり困った時はキャンセルまたは再要請をお願いします。\nご縁があると嬉しいです。何卒よろしくお願いします🙇‍♀️", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@9m7M9/works/18", "thumbnail_src